    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nBack to listing\nBLUEINK + SLACK\nGet instant envelope updates from Blueink without leaving Slack.\n\nSend the document notifications straight to your Slack account with no code required, keeping you informed of important updates without the need to switch between multiple apps. Whether it’s a signature completion or a status change, you’ll receive real-time alerts, ensuring you stay organized and responsive. Manage your entire document workflow in one place, saving time and reducing distractions.\n\nGet a demo\nKeep your team updated at every\nstep of the document process\nStay in the Loop\n\nReceive instant push notifications in Slack as soon as a client signs a document, so you can keep track of progress without getting lost in your inbox. No more digging through emails—stay updated in real time and focus on what matters most.\n\nReceive reminders when documents are ready for download\n\nGet instant notifications when your documents are ready for download with Blueink for Slack. Make sure you never miss an important file by staying informed about bundle details, signer information, and download URLs straight in your Slack channel or private message.\n\nWho uses Blueink for\nSlack Integration?\nHuman Resources\nKeep your HR team organized and efficient by managing hiring documents, contracts, and employee agreements with ease. Blueink for Slack allows HR professionals to track and receive instant notifications on document progress, reducing delays and ensuring quick, secure signatures.\nIT\nEnhance IT workflows by integrating Blueink with Slack, allowing your team to monitor approvals, agreements, and internal processes in real time. With automated document tracking and secure storage, your IT department can maintain seamless operations without leaving their communication hub.\nProcurement\nSpeed up procurement processes by using Blueink for Slack to manage purchase orders, contracts, and vendor agreements. Stay informed of every document’s status, from submission to completion, ensuring timely approvals and keeping your supply chain moving smoothly.\nEnhancing signer experiences, building trust\n50%\nMore cost-effective\nthan DocuSign\n4.9/5\nCustomer\nsatisfaction score\n3 min\nAverage support response time\n0\nZero overage\npenalties\nSee what our partners have to say\nMarketing and Advertising\nAdam R.\nSales Director\nExceptional digital signature technology for less than the competition\nThis is an exceptional product for digital signature for less than the competition.\nTechnology\nAli P.\nVP Sales Engineering\nGreat flexible product with easy integration and customer support\nGreat company with very flexible tools and excellent customer experience.\nHospitality\nAmy K.\nDirector of Sales\nMakes my life much easier!\nThe two biggest positive changes are how much time I save completing the contract process and how quickly I receive the signed contracts back from the client.\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nFinancial Services\nAyaz S.\nManagement Consultant\nGreat Product and Value\nGreat value compared to other products and was easy to implement within our platforms. The company provides white glove service and support.\nGovernment\nBeth M.\nHuman Resources & Compliance\nHuman Resources paperwork streamlined\nBlueInk has streamlined our processes to ensure that all the required paperwork is collected in a timely manner with the proper signature.\nFAQs\nWhat is the Blueink and Slack integration?\n\nThe Blueink and Slack integration allows you to manage your e-signature workflows directly from Slack. You can receive notifications, track document status, and take actions like reminding signers, all within your Slack workspace.\n\n‍\n\nHow do I set up Blueink with Slack?\n\nTo connect Slack with your Blueink account, start by logging into your Blueink account and navigating to the \"Marketplace\" section within the account settings. Once you're in the Marketplace, search for \"Slack\" and select the option to connect it. You will then be prompted to authorize Blueink’s access to your Slack workspace. After completing the authorization process, Slack will be successfully integrated with Blueink, allowing you to receive notifications and manage your e-signature workflows directly from within your Slack channels.\n\nCan I customize notifications from Blueink in Slack?\n\nYes, you can customize the types of notifications you receive. You can choose to be notified when documents are sent, signed, or completed, or when a signer has not completed a document within a certain timeframe.\n\nCan I customize the Slack integration?\n\nYes, you can customize the Slack integration using Blueink Connect. This allows you to create different workflows that suit your specific needs, enabling more control over how notifications are received, which actions trigger alerts, and how documents are managed through Slack. You can tailor the integration to fit seamlessly into your team’s existing processes.\n\nCan I track multiple document workflows through Slack channels?\n\nYes, you can assign document notifications to specific Slack channels. This allows your team to stay updated on multiple workflows, helping ensure that no document is overlooked.\n\nReady to get started?\nGet in touch with Blueink.\nStart Free 14-Day Trial!\nFEATURES\nBulk Send\nSMS Delivery\nSmart Link Forms\nSigning Brands\nTeams\nIn-Person Signing\nSOLUTIONS\nINDUSTRY\nGovernment\nEducation\nHealthcare\nHousing\nInsurance\nStaffing\nSenior Living\n\nFinancial Services\nRetail\nTechnology\nDEPARTMENT\nFinance\nProcurement\nHuman Resources\nCourts\nLegal\nSales\nOperations\nCivil Service\nIT\nCOMPARE BLUEINK\nvs Adobe Sign\nvs DocuSign\nvs Dropbox Sign\nvs Foxit Sign\nvs PandaDoc\nvs SignNow\nAPI\nAPI Overview\nAPI SDKs & Libraries\nDocumentation\nAPI Plans & Pricing\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nWhite Papers\nCase Studies\nCompetitors\neSignature Laws\nHelp Center\nSample Documents\nFAQ\nCompliance\nSystem Status\nQUICK LINKS\nHome\nAbout Us\nPricing\nIntegration\nPartner\n\nContact Us\n2014 – 2026 © Blueink. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nCookies Policy"
